# No API key or configuration is required.
#
# The reference agent is deterministic and never contacts a model provider,
# so this example runs (and its validating test passes) with no credentials.
#
# Optional: adjust tracing verbosity (diagnostics are written to stderr).
# RUST_LOG=info,adk_acp=debug

# Optional: require clients to authenticate with the `workspace-token` method.
# ACP_EXAMPLE_TOKEN=any-non-empty-value
